{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean City Pack is a 3D model asset pack perfect for creating games set in modern urban environments. It includes a wide variety of everyday city objects such as skyscrapers, apartment buildings, roads, traffic lights, fences, street lamps, benches, and more. <br><br>The building models are modular, with parts divided by floor, allowing you to freely assemble structures of different heights and shapes. By designing the cityscape from the player's perspective, you can create a more immersive and dynamic urban setting. <br><br>With just a few adjustments, you can easily recreate the atmosphere of a bustling city. Switching between day and night lighting dramatically changes the mood of the environment. Ideal for crime investigations, school dramas, adventure games, horror, and many other genres. <br><br>[Clean City Kit] Contents </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Sample Map: 1 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 3D Stamps: 556 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000- Buildings: 179 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000- Streets: 31 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000- Props: 265 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000- Kitbash: 4 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000- Prefabs: 77 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Terrain: 5</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093410?t=1761783800","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093410?t=1761783800","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093410/a2f6bf03cd09e3c9a3cbe1c9be450f009b212780/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761783800","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093410/a2f6bf03cd09e3c9a3cbe1c9be450f009b212780/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761783800","categories":[{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Su